  "prefLabel": "He-P 4062.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4062.01 Purpose. The purpose of this rule is to set forth the requirements that the waste generator must comply with to show that the material in question is properly classified, described, packaged, marked, labeled and is in proper condition for transport.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p4062-4097.html"
